sers/AdriaandeJongh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Played with this PR a bit. Some of my thoughts:\n\n- when only _skimming over code_, I liked this more than I thought I would.\n- I dislike not being able to drag-select text when the mouse pointer starts on top of one of these boxes.\n- when _writing code_, I find this PR to be lacking and actually potentially quite annoying due to the hints appearing and disappearing. For example, here's a video of me playing a bit dumb:\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/4947abe3-d0bd-427b-a31b-1234606ebaa5\n\nJust based on this video alone, I think there's already some things that would need improvements, such as:\n1. already show the inline hint when the parameter hasn't been filled in yet.\n2. the line jumping when there's errors is really disorienting. would love to avoid that somehow, keep the hints there even when there's errors?","state":"COMMENTED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113214#pullrequestreview-3832726691","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/113214","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113214#pullrequestreview-3832726691"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/113214"}},"submitted_at":"2026-02-20T15:40:33Z","commit_id":"675a172b5e316f2be9c0b6879ea7cd63aa8d97e2"}]